{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PowerWash Simulator is back, satisfaction is a spray away!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dust off your power washer and relax into pure feel-good fun. Blast away every last speck, smear and splatter of filth to restore Muckingham (and beyond \ud83d\udc40) to gleaming glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/f9fdd7ea151b6e8fe7d14653370dff14.poster.avif?t=1768317251\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/f9fdd7ea151b6e8fe7d14653370dff14.webm?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/f9fdd7ea151b6e8fe7d14653370dff14.mp4?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craving more to Clean?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jobs and water keep flowing in PowerWash Simulator 2. Play through a fresh new campaign, uncovering more of Muckingham\u2019s mysteries. Plus, venture even further out to brand-new grime-coated locations like Sponge Valley, Power Falls and Lubri City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside new locations and jobs, you\u2019ll also find a new job type. Multi-stage jobs will unlock different areas of a job \u2013 from vehicle interiors to entirely different rooms, your to-do list keeps growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/96afdedadb96f32b06a2a254044bb3df.poster.avif?t=1768317251\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/96afdedadb96f32b06a2a254044bb3df.webm?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/96afdedadb96f32b06a2a254044bb3df.mp4?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tools of the Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach new heights of power washing professionalism with a range of new tools to help you achieve a spectacular sparkle, high and low. Realise even your loftiest cleaning ambitions with the help of an all-new abseiling rig and cherry picker or stay grounded with a grime busting surface cleaner for large areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/9b6c4c22c32564b284a30d70a7ffe721.poster.avif?t=1768317251\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/9b6c4c22c32564b284a30d70a7ffe721.webm?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/9b6c4c22c32564b284a30d70a7ffe721.mp4?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Place like your Home-base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick back and relax in your home-base after a hard-days-cleaning. Make the place yours by collecting furniture and trinkets to spruce it up along the way, then invite your power wash pals over to check out your pad.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/15f6940eb5375622470f8ba80b534c43.poster.avif?t=1768317251\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/15f6940eb5375622470f8ba80b534c43.webm?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/15f6940eb5375622470f8ba80b534c43.mp4?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You didn\u2019t think we\u2019d leave your furry friends in the van, did you? Your pretty kitties are the purr-fect distraction for when you\u2019ve pressed paws on work for the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/0660048e1cb08993f6794807cfd9c4b2.poster.avif?t=1768317251\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/0660048e1cb08993f6794807cfd9c4b2.webm?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/0660048e1cb08993f6794807cfd9c4b2.mp4?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soap-erior Washing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your worries melt away with each swipe of your power washer. Cleaning feels even better in PowerWash Simulator 2, with enhanced soap that clings to stubborn stains and annihilates dirt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/ec26488bb1bb8630d798d83f2398e1c4.poster.avif?t=1768317251\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/ec26488bb1bb8630d798d83f2398e1c4.webm?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/ec26488bb1bb8630d798d83f2398e1c4.mp4?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clean in Split-screen!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfaction on the double! Share campaign progression online together for the first time. In addition to online play, split-screen co-op has entered the chat. Team up and take on the dirt with twice the wash-power, from the convenience of one screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/32e2bc4c3b59203fa948a3e35b75e7de.poster.avif?t=1768317251\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/32e2bc4c3b59203fa948a3e35b75e7de.webm?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/32e2bc4c3b59203fa948a3e35b75e7de.mp4?t=1768317251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2025/2026 Content Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the rest of 2025, we're focusing on fixes, quality-of-life improvements, and will have some small content drops in the form of furniture and cosmetics ahead of bigger updates next year:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/f566acebf261ef15321f61c2bb124ab8.avif?t=1768317251\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All Moved In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/ee309350d804b50927f3c2910518e196a1381b15.jpg"},{"name":"It All Comes Out in the Wash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/89814d37a635f8875f270d36316bc366daa9358b.jpg"},{"name":"Leading Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/0e35aff4d5caadca9cb1a5e83622a9a5a3993f6b.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Medium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/66c25bb50a6fe62446d4ce331ac2a31ffa7a0d8a.jpg"},{"name":"Heavy Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/96880caf815a849ba500ad2abb325f0ab100ab07.jpg"},{"name":"Consummate Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/15983ffb40bb43e65216c73066d27604a05ba12a.jpg"},{"name":"Maxed Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/277455ec6bb5f0932804d7839eb8484b7b0dc308.jpg"},{"name":"Home Decor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/68f406e38e20320b79245fc2d67ceab7d6c6a8cc.jpg"},{"name":"Taking Note","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/56ba681cbe2a0aaf0d2a8b34111af39743ccaf01.jpg"},{"name":"Geo-Cashing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968420/574258f9203b929a7dee87ddedfab3bc0dddfa6c.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968420?t=1768317251","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/2744a3d947520f5f14fba94d79514a7433047ba8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768317251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/33ef3ac597ce9813b4eb8da4eace0f5cb51869e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768317251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/33ef3ac597ce9813b4eb8da4eace0f5cb51869e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768317251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4043170,"description":""},{"appid":4043170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>PowerWash Simulator 2 - Adventure Time Pack</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/1e32106f320703ec0837d3e21596c06c.avif?t=1768317251\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What time is it?! The new Adventure Time Pack is set to bring the Ooo to PowerWash Simulator TwOoo. Grab your friends and blast away grime from distant lands or clean up the wreckage of the world as a solo adventurer in five jobs from the world of Adventure Time \u2013 the fun will never end! WISHLIST NOW!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PowerWash Simulator is back, satisfaction is a spray away!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dust off your power washer and relax into pure feel-good fun. Blast away every last speck, smear and splatter of filth to restore Muckingham (and beyond \ud83d\udc40) to gleaming glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"